screentext:Op de camping — zet de champagne maar klaar                 in @@bar:30   out @@bar:34     at 0.5,0.84  size 34  center  fade 0.3
screentext:Op de camping — 's avonds knokken met elkaar                in @@bar:34   out @@bar:38     at 0.5,0.84  size 34  center  fade 0.3
screentext:Op de camping (op de camping)                               in @@bar:38   out @@bar:42     at 0.5,0.84  size 34  center  fade 0.3
